This course has no cast list.

The `people` collection stays declared in src/content.config.ts because the
starter is explicit that the four graph collections are part of the fixed
platform. It is deliberately empty: inventing named lecturers, biographies and
office hours would be furniture. The useful prerequisites, teaching format,
lab rules, accessibility guidance and assessment summary remain on the course
information page.

This file exists so the glob loader has a directory to find.
